{
  "id": 1021,
  "name": "ss-ticket--letsgo",
  "fling_power": null,
  "fling_effect": null,
  "attributes": [],
  "category": {
    "name": "plot-advancement",
    "url": "/api/v2/item-category/22/"
  },
  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "サント・アンヌごうに　のるとき\nひつような　ふねの　チケット。\nふねの　えが　かかれている。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "상트앙느호에 탈 때\n필요한 승선 티켓.\n배 그림이 그려져 있다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "乘搭聖特安努號時\n所需的船票。\n上面畫了一艘船。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un ticket nécessaire pour embarquer à bord\nde L’Océane. Il y a une image du navire dessus.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Ein Ticket, das benötigt wird, um an Bord der MS Anne\nzu gehen. Das Schiff ist darauf abgebildet.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Billete necesario para embarcar en el S. S. Anne. Tiene\ndibujado un barco.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Biglietto per salire sulla Motonave Anna.\nC’è disegnata sopra una nave.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The ticket required to board the S.S. Anne.\nIt has a drawing of a ship on it.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "サント・アンヌ号に　乗るとき\n必要な　船の　チケット。\n船の　絵が　描かれている。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "乘坐圣特安努号时所需的船票。\n上面绘有船只的图案。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      }
    },
